Shit! We should be keeping up.

11
00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:42.271
- You sure the throttle's open?
- Wide open.

12
00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:47.075
Come on. you overgrown goldfish!
Come to Uncle Jake.

13
00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:51.833
- How long have you known Hoagie?
- What?

14
00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.598
How long have you known Hoagie?

15
00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:55.995
