are flying drugs down here.

26
00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:32.830
- He's always going off somewhere.
- Bring her about. now!

27
00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:36.634
- I am!
- Hurry. man. we're losir him!

28
00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:38.989
