He likes gambling.
he likes women. don't bother me!

30
00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:44.669
- He flies charter...
- Damn! We lost him!

31
00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:48.671
Maybe your gear crapped out.

32
00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:52.315
Maybe you crapped out.
flappir your lips about Hoagie.

33
00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:00.074
Do you want subtitles for any video?
-=[ ai.OpenSubtitles.com ]=-

34
