00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:50.750
(Man on radio)
'Hoagie. where are you? '

245
00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:55.112
12 miles southeast of Emerald Key.
Look for Neptune's Folly.'

246
00:22:57.880 --> 00:23:01.475
I need two boats fast and somebody
who can kill a shark - a big one.

247
00:23:01.520 --> 00:23:04.592
(Man) 'What're you doing? '
(Hoagie) Practising landing.

248
00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:07.029
Hang on to your socks. lads.

249
00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:09.640
Wait! You sure you know
how to do this?

250
00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:13.229
0f course not!
What kind of pilot do you think I am?

251
00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:28.677
- Christ!
- Hell. not half bad.

252
00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:30.631
Get out. I'll keep it busy.

253
00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:34.673
No. it'll come for the plane's
electromagnetic impulse.

254
00:23:34.720 --> 00:23:37.280
(Hoagie) Get the bloody hell out!

255
00:23:37.320 --> 00:23:38.514
Michael!

256
00:23:48.480 --> 00:23:53.838
Damn passengers! You're all the same.
Complain. complain...

257
00:23:53.880 --> 00:23:55.393
0h. shit!

258
00:23:57.760 --> 00:23:58.795
Hoagie!

259
00:24:01.640 --> 00:24:04.473
Hoagie! Hoagie!

260
00:24:24.480 --> 00:24:27.392
Why'd you come out here?

261
00:24:30.520 --> 00:24:32.112
Why'd you come out here?

262
00:24:32.160 --> 00:24:34.310
- Why did you bring him?
- Mom. Mom!

263
00:24:34.360 --> 00:24:37.158
- Why'd you take the boat?
- It kept coming!

264
00:24:37.200 --> 00:24:40.556
- Didrt you realise?
- There was nothing else to do.

265
00:24:40.640 --> 00:24:43.837
- You shouldn't have done it.
- I tried to tell you.

266
00:24:43.880 --> 00:24:46.269
I tried. (Sobbing)

267
00:24:50.800 --> 00:24:53.678
(Hoagie) Hey!
Give me a hand. for Christ's sake!

268
00:24:53.720 --> 00:24:56.678
- Hoagie!
- How the hell did you do that. man?

269
00:24:56.720 --> 00:24:59.518
- It wasrt easy. believe me.
- Get him up.

270
00:24:59.560 --> 00:25:01.676
(Grunting)

271
00:25:02.720 --> 00:25:04.756
(Jake) You all right. man?

272
00:25:04.800 --> 00:25:08.031
- 0h! Bloody hell.
- (Jake) Get it started!

273
00:25:08.080 --> 00:25:11.038
- The breath on that thing!
- You are alive!

274
00:25:11.080 --> 00:25:13.514
Let's get out of here.
Ellen Brody. 0h!

275
00:25:13.560 --> 00:25:15.835
Good. this thing's still working.

276
00:25:15.880 --> 00:25:16.869
(Engine spluttering)

277
00:25:16.920 --> 00:25:19.195
That's your engine. pal.
I'll have a look.

278
00:25:21.760 --> 00:25:22.749
(Electronic beating)

279
00:25:22.800 --> 00:25:24.995
0h. shit. he's close. man.

280
00:25:25.040 --> 00:25:28.157
- What is that sound?
- The shark's heartbeat.

281
00:25:28.200 --> 00:25:31.909
Hoagie. try to finish.
Michael. gimme a hand. I got an idea.

282
00:25:31.960 --> 00:25:35.873
We're taking water down here.
Ellen. start pumping here.

283
00:25:36.920 --> 00:25:39.832
(Hoagie) Ellen! Get the bilge pump!

284
00:25:39.880 --> 00:25:44.271
(Jake) Take the radio transmitter out
and hook it to the strobe.

285
00:25:44.320 --> 00:25:47.756
- We gotta get the engine started!
- Just do it!

286
00:25:47.800 --> 00:25:50.758
We're gonna feed that big boy
a meal he won't forget.

287
00:25:50.800 --> 00:25:55.112
You better have something good going.
We've got a rotten hose.

288
00:25:55.160 --> 00:25:58.436
There's a spare one.
What you wanna do with this?

289
00:25:58.480 --> 00:26:03.508
I'm riggir the receiver. We get it
inside that bastard and set it off.

290
00:26:03.560 --> 00:26:07.519
I got it. We rig an antenna on this.
we can shock the hell out of him.

291
00:26:07.560 --> 00:26:09.039
Right! You're learning.

292
00:26:09.080 --> 00:26:10.991
(Beating intensifies)

293
00:26:12.320 --> 00:26:13.799
He's getting closer!

294
00:26:13.840 --> 00:26:18.470
They spend their lives looking for
food. they don't care what it is.

295
00:26:18.520 --> 00:26:21.353
Maybe he's got indigestion.
He's eaten my plane!

296
00:26:23.320 --> 00:26:25.436
It's not food he's after.

297
00:26:25.480 --> 00:26:28.313
Michael. turn on your switch.
I need a test.

298
00:26:28.360 --> 00:26:31.238
- Anybody tell you you're nuts?
- All the time.

299
00:26:31.280 --> 00:26:34.238
If it responds
to external electrical impulse.

300
00:26:34.280 --> 00:26:37.989
it might respond to one inside -
confuse him. drive him crazy.

301
00:26:38.040 --> 00:26:40.679
- (Electrical whine)
- 0K. a test... Good.

302
00:26:44.520 --> 00:26:48.229
You'd better get up here!
The heartbeat's stopped!

303
00:26:53.680 --> 00:26:55.272
Shit.

304
00:26:55.320 --> 00:26:58.835
Either he's gone
or your gear's crapped out again.

305
00:26:59.880 --> 00:27:04.112
That's bull. My equipment
don't crap out. He'll be back.

306
00:27:04.160 --> 00:27:06.833
(Jake) Get me the boat hook.

307
00:27:06.880 --> 00:27:11.476
(Hoagie) Maybe he had a heart attack.
Humans are full of cholesterol.

308
00:27:11.520 --> 00:27:13.590
- Give me that.
- Shit! Where is he?

309
00:27:15.640 --> 00:27:18.552
Give me that line. Michael.
Right there.

310
00:27:19.600 --> 00:27:21.033
There he is!

311
00:27:22.880 --> 00:27:25.348
(Hoagie) Ellen. try the engine.

312
00:27:26.680 --> 00:27:28.989
Ellen! Try to start the engine!

313
00:27:32.280 --> 00:27:33.599
(Engine starts)

314
00:27:33.640 --> 00:27:36.632
Son of a bitch.
Let's get out of here.

315
00:27:36.680 --> 00:27:40.719
No. it's too late. Hoagie.
Give me a hard port.

316
00:27:40.760 --> 00:27:42.478
Right!

317
00:27:42.520 --> 00:27:47.196
(Michael) Here. give me that.
(Jake) No! No time for that!

318
00:27:47.240 --> 00:27:50.198
Jake! You can't go out there
without a line!

319
00:27:52.840 --> 00:27:55.559
Keep it steady.
It's gonna come back!

320
00:28:12.240 --> 00:28:15.357
Damn thing's disappeared. He's gone!

321
00:28:42.080 --> 00:28:44.071
(Electronic heartbeat)

322
00:28:50.640 --> 00:28:56.829
Jake!

323
00:29:23.840 --> 00:29:26.991
We're taking too much water.
It'll stop the engine.

324
00:29:27.040 --> 00:29:30.077
Ellen. take the wheel.
We've got to outrun it. Ellen!

325
00:29:46.480 --> 00:29:50.155
- That thing gonna work?
- It'll work.

326
00:29:50.200 --> 00:29:53.476
If Jake says so. it will.
This charge will drive it crazy.

327
00:30:34.640 --> 00:30:36.232
(High-pitched drone)

328
00:30:36.280 --> 00:30:37.315
(Roaring)

329
00:30:40.440 --> 00:30:41.634
(Roaring)

330
00:30:43.320 --> 00:30:45.436
(Drone turns to patchy static)

331
00:30:54.840 --> 00:30:57.912
Sweet Jesus.
we're headed straight for it!

332
00:30:57.960 --> 00:31:00.349
Ellen. come about!

333
00:31:02.000 --> 00:31:03.797
(Drone resumes)

334
00:31:04.840 --> 00:31:06.114
(Roaring)

335
00:31:06.160 --> 00:31:09.755
(Hoagie) We're gonna hit it!
Hold on!

336
00:31:09.800 --> 00:31:11.279
Hold on!

337
00:31:12.440 --> 00:31:14.635
Smile. you son of a bitch!

338
00:31:40.080 --> 00:31:41.229
- Michael!
- Come over here.

339
00:31:45.280 --> 00:31:46.679
Michael!

340
00:31:46.720 --> 00:31:49.359
It's all right! I'm 0K!

341
00:31:49.400 --> 00:31:52.517
(Man) Anybody there? 0ver here!

342
00:31:55.720 --> 00:31:56.948
Jake!

343
00:31:59.480 --> 00:32:02.119
Michael. you got a minute?

344
00:32:02.160 --> 00:32:04.594
It's Jake!

345
00:32:07.360 --> 00:32:09.316
Son of a bitch!

346
00:32:19.800 --> 00:32:21.631
Jesus. Jake.

347
00:32:25.080 --> 00:32:28.755
What took you so damn long. man?

348
00:32:28.800 --> 00:32:31.189
What the hell are you doing alive?

349
00:32:31.240 --> 00:32:34.949
I told you Uncle Jake's
equipment don't crap out. eh?

350
00:32:37.680 --> 00:32:41.559
You're not going to do something
stupid like die on me. are you?

351
00:32:41.600 --> 00:32:45.115
No. man. I'm way too mean for that.

352
00:32:52.000 --> 00:32:55.072
So from now on.
we're going to study snails. eh?

353
00:32:55.120 --> 00:32:56.712
Yeah.

354
00:33:01.240 --> 00:33:03.629
(Ellen) Come to Amity this summer.

355
00:33:03.680 --> 00:33:06.752
(Carla) We'll be there.
(Ellen) You make sure they come.

356
00:33:06.800 --> 00:33:09.394
(Thea) I will.
I'll miss you. Grandma.

357
00:33:11.080 --> 00:33:13.992
Get in. Ellen Brody.
You'll miss your plane.

358
00:33:14.040 --> 00:33:16.508
- Goodbye. Grandma!
- 0K.

359
00:33:16.600 --> 00:33:18.875
- Be careful.
- 0K. See ya.

360
00:33:19.960 --> 00:33:22.315
- Take good care of Jake.
- I will.

361
00:33:23.760 --> 00:33:26.320
You gonna be 0K?

362
00:33:26.360 --> 00:33:29.352
- Yeah.
- 0K.

363
00:33:30.160 --> 00:33:33.789
When I come back.
remind me to tell you about the time

364
00:33:33.840 --> 00:33:36.070
I took a hundred nuns to Nairobi.

365
00:33:41.560 --> 00:33:45.189
(Hoagie) There they were.
100 nuns. playing guitars

366
00:33:45.240 --> 00:33:49.153
and singing. 'The hills are alive
with the sound of music.'

367
00:33:49.200 --> 00:33:52.829
Then suddenly.
one comes up to me and she says.

368
00:33:52.880 --> 00:33:55.838
'There's smoke coming
from the engine.'

369
00:33:55.880 --> 00:33:58.633
But I never
took them seriously.

370
00:33:58.680 --> 00:34:01.752
until they all started singing
'Nearer My God to Thee.'

371
